const content="<article data-editorial-version=\"3\" class=\"sn-page\"><div class=\"sn-read\"><a href=\"/supporters/\">← Featured sponsors</a><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Marine Diesel Engine · Sponsor feature</p><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/captain-matt/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"Captain Matt logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\"><h1>Captain Matt: marine engineering, vessel services and private charters</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Captain Matt takes enquiries for engineering, captaincy, deliveries and vessel operations, alongside private Sydney Harbour charters through Exclusive Boats. For owners, the business offers experienced professional involvement with a boat as well as organised outings for private groups.</p><img class=\"sn-hero\" src=\"/images/supporters/captain-matt/charter.webp\" alt=\"Matt Dawe aboard an Exclusive Boats vessel\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\"><section><h2>Practical experience with vessel systems</h2><p>Matt Dawe has a Royal Australian Navy engineering background, including work with machinery and electrical systems. That is relevant to owners who want to discuss a vessel task with someone whose experience extends beyond hosting a charter.</p><p>We like that the business states actual services. An owner can enquire about engineering, an operational requirement, captaincy or a delivery and explain the work involved. The technical background helps substantiate the service rather than becoming a biography unrelated to the purchase.</p></section><section><h2>Private days on Sydney Harbour</h2><p>Exclusive Boats&#x27; main charter vessel is LIFES GOOD, a 40-foot catamaran, with other boats available by arrangement. Birthdays, family gatherings and work celebrations are among the advertised occasions, with swimming and barbecue options to discuss.</p><p>Quotes are prepared individually around the booking. Matt&#x27;s charter experience includes more than 60 Yacht Week charter weeks, supporting the guest-facing side of the business.</p></section><section><h2>Why we feature Captain Matt</h2><p>Boat ownership requires people with practical skills as well as equipment. We feature Captain Matt because his offering includes professional vessel work backed by engineering and operating experience.</p><p>The charter service provides a separate option when the aim is simply an enjoyable day with your own group. Customers can approach the business with a defined need, whether that is work involving their vessel or a private harbour occasion with someone else running the boat.</p></section><div class=\"sn-contact\"><a href=\"https://captainmatt.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Talk to Captain Matt ↗</a><a href=\"/supporters/\">More featured sponsors</a></div></div></article><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Captain Matt: marine engineering, vessel services and private charters\", \"description\": \"Captain Matt takes enquiries for engineering, captaincy, deliveries and vessel operations, alongside private Sydney Harbour charters through Exclusive Boats.\", \"image\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/images/supporters/captain-matt/charter.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Marine Diesel Engine\"}, \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-05\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/supporters/captain-matt/\"}</script>";
